{"step_index":119,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-11T14:48:36Z","thinking":"**Identifying relevant library theorems**\n\nThe definitions `Finset.mem_of_max` and `Finset.mem_of_min` appear directly applicable. They provide the logical bridge between the maximum/minimum element of a set and membership within that set. These theorems could be crucial in proving the proposition in `Candidate`.\n\n\n**Constructing the proof structure**\n\nThe proof starts by introducing the necessary graph and set variables, and unfolds the definitions of independent number and edge cover number. Cases are used on maximum independent set size and minimum edge cover size. The goal is to establish a relationship between these two values, leveraging the properties of independent sets and edge covers.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"\"cat << 'EOF' > scratch.lean\\nimport Mathlib\\nimport LeanProject.GraphInvariantsComputable\\n\\nset_option maxRecDepth 10000\\n\\nopen SimpleGraph Finset\\n\\nabbrev Candidate : Prop :=\\n    ∀ {V : Type} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\\n    (G : SimpleGraph V) [DecidableRel G.Adj],\\n      GraphCalc.IsNontrivialClass G → GraphCalc.HasEdgeCover G → GraphCalc.indepNum G ≤ GraphCalc.edgeCoverNumber G\\n\\nlemma sym2_eq_of_ne_mem {V : Type*} [DecidableEq V] (u v : V) (e : Sym2 V)\\n    (hu : u ∈ e) (hv : v ∈ e) (hne : u ≠ v) : e = s(u, v) := by\\n  induction e using Sym2.inductionOn with\\n  | hf a b =>\\n    rw [Sym2.mem_iff] at hu hv\\n    rcases hu with rfl | rfl <;> rcases hv with rfl | rfl\\n    · contradiction\\n    · rfl\\n    · exact Sym2.eq_swap\\n    · contradiction\\n\\nlemma indep_card_le_edge_cover_card {V : Type*} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\\n    (G : SimpleGraph V) [DecidableRel G.Adj]\\n    (I : Finset V) (hI : GraphCalc.IsIndependentFinset G I)\\n    (s : Finset (Sym2 V)) (hs_sub : s ⊆ G.edgeFinset) (hs_cov : GraphCalc.IsEdgeCoverFinset G s) :\\n    I.card ≤ s.card := by\\n  let f : V → Sym2 V := fun v => Classical.choose (hs_cov v)\\n  have hf_spec : ∀ v, f v ∈ s ∧ v ∈ f v := fun v => Classical.choose_spec (hs_cov v)\\n  have hmaps : Set.MapsTo f (↑I) (↑s) := by\\n    intro v _\\n    exact (hf_spec v).1\\n  have hinj : Set.InjOn f (↑I) := by\\n    intro u hu v hv heq\\n    by_contra hne\\n    have hu_e : u ∈ f u := (hf_spec u).2\\n    have hv_e : v ∈ f u := by rw [heq]; exact (hf_spec v).2\\n    have he_eq : f u = s(u, v) := sym2_eq_of_ne_mem u v (f u) hu_e hv_e hne\\n    have he_in_s : f u ∈ s := (hf_spec u).1\\n    have he_in_edges : f u ∈ G.edgeFinset := hs_sub he_in_s\\n    rw [SimpleGraph.mem_edgeFinset] at he_in_edges\\n    rw [he_eq] at he_in_edges\\n    rw [SimpleGraph.mem_edgeSet] at he_in_edges\\n    have h_not_adj : ¬ G.Adj u v := hI u hu v hv\\n    exact h_not_adj he_in_edges\\n  exact Finset.card_le_card_of_injOn f hmaps hinj\\n\\ntheorem prove_1facfd37 : Candidate := by\\n  intro V _ _ G\n<truncated 1665 bytes>","Cwd":"\"/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/handoff/promising13/task_1facfd37\"","WaitMsBeforeAsync":"10000","toolAction":"\"Testing full proof in scratch.lean\"","toolSummary":"\"Test full proof in scratch.lean\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
{"step_index":120,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"RUNNING","created_at":"2026-09-11T14:48:43Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-11T16:48:43+02:00\nTool is running as a background task with task id: 42667f07-7a6a-4c4a-956f-ef86057f6aae/task-120\nTask Description: cat << 'EOF' > scratch.lean\nimport Mathlib\nimport LeanProject.GraphInvariantsComputable\n\nset_option maxRecDepth 10000\n\nopen SimpleGraph Finset\n\nabbrev Candidate : Prop :=\n    ∀ {V : Type} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\n    (G : SimpleGraph V) [DecidableRel G.Adj],\n      GraphCalc.IsNontrivialClass G → GraphCalc.HasEdgeCover G → GraphCalc.indepNum G ≤ GraphCalc.edgeCoverNumber G\n\nlemma sym2_eq_of_ne_mem {V : Type*} [DecidableEq V] (u v : V) (e : Sym2 V)\n    (hu : u ∈ e) (hv : v ∈ e) (hne : u ≠ v) : e = s(u, v) := by\n  induction e using Sym2.inductionOn with\n  | hf a b =>\n    rw [Sym2.mem_iff] at hu hv\n    rcases hu with rfl | rfl <;> rcases hv with rfl | rfl\n    · contradiction\n    · rfl\n    · exact Sym2.eq_swap\n    · contradiction\n\nlemma indep_card_le_edge_cover_card {V : Type*} [Fintype V] [DecidableEq V]\n    (G : SimpleGraph V) [DecidableRel G.Adj]\n    (I : Finset V) (hI : GraphCalc.IsIndependentFinset G I)\n    (s : Finset (Sym2 V)) (hs_sub : s ⊆ G.edgeFinset) (hs_cov : GraphCalc.IsEdgeCoverFinset G s) :\n    I.card ≤ s.card := by\n  let f : V → Sym2 V := fun v => Classical.choose (hs_cov v)\n  have hf_spec : ∀ v, f v ∈ s ∧ v ∈ f v := fun v => Classical.choose_spec (hs_cov v)\n  have hmaps : Set.MapsTo f (↑I) (↑s) := by\n    intro v _\n    exact (hf_spec v).1\n  have hinj : Set.InjOn f (↑I) := by\n    intro u hu v hv heq\n    by_contra hne\n    have hu_e : u ∈ f u := (hf_spec u).2\n    have hv_e : v ∈ f u := by rw [heq]; exact (hf_spec v).2\n    have he_eq : f u = s(u, v) := sym2_eq_of_ne_mem u v (f u) hu_e hv_e hne\n    have he_in_s : f u ∈ s := (hf_spec u).1\n    have he_in_edges : f u ∈ G.edgeFinset := hs_sub he_in_s\n    rw [SimpleGraph.mem_edgeFinset] at he_in_edges\n    rw [he_eq] at he_in_edges\n    rw [SimpleGraph.mem_edgeSet] at he_in_edges\n    have h_not_adj : ¬ G.Adj u v := hI u hu v hv\n    exact h_not_adj he_in_edges\n  exa\n<truncated 92 bytes>\nro V _ _ G _ _ _\n  dsimp [GraphCalc.indepNum, GraphCalc.edgeCoverNumber, GraphCalc.minUpTo]\n  cases hmax : ((univ.powerset.filter (GraphCalc.IsIndependentFinset G)).image Finset.card).max with\n  | none =>\n    simp [hmax]\n  | some alpha =>\n    simp only [hmax, Option.getD_some]\n    have h_alpha_mem : alpha ∈ ((univ.powerset.filter (GraphCalc.IsIndependentFinset G)).image Finset.card) :=\n      Finset.mem_of_max hmax\n    rw [Finset.mem_image] at h_alpha_mem\n    rcases h_alpha_mem with ⟨I, hI, hI_card⟩\n    rw [Finset.mem_filter] at hI\n    have hI_indep : GraphCalc.IsIndependentFinset G I := hI.2\n    cases hmin : (((range (Fintype.card V + 1)).filter\n      (fun k => ∃ s ∈ G.edgeFinset.powersetCard k, GraphCalc.IsEdgeCoverFinset G s)).min) with\n    | none =>\n      simp only [hmin, Option.getD_none]\n      subst hI_card\n      exact Finset.card_le_univ I\n    | some rho =>\n      simp only [hmin, Option.getD_some]\n      have h_rho_mem : rho ∈ (((range (Fintype.card V + 1)).filter\n        (fun k => ∃ s ∈ G.edgeFinset.powersetCard k, GraphCalc.IsEdgeCoverFinset G s))) :=\n        Finset.mem_of_min hmin\n      rw [Finset.mem_filter] at h_rho_mem\n      rcases h_rho_mem.2 with ⟨s, hs_pow, hs_cov⟩\n      rw [Finset.mem_powersetCard] at hs_pow\n      have hs_sub : s ⊆ G.edgeFinset := hs_pow.1\n      have hs_card : s.card = rho := hs_pow.2\n      have h_le := indep_card_le_edge_cover_card G I hI_indep s hs_sub hs_cov\n      rw [hI_card, hs_card] at h_le\n      exact h_le\n\ntheorem refute_1facfd37 : ¬ Candidate := by\n  sorry\n\nEOF\n/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/tools/antigravity/check.sh scratch.lean\n\nTask logs are available at: file:///tmp/agyhome.ORAQte/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/42667f07-7a6a-4c4a-956f-ef86057f6aae/.system_generated/tasks/task-120.