{"step_index":143,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"RUNNING","created_at":"2026-09-11T14:49:42Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-11T16:49:42+02:00\nTool is running as a background task with task id: 42667f07-7a6a-4c4a-956f-ef86057f6aae/task-143\nTask Description: cat << 'EOF' > scratch.lean\nimport Mathlib\nimport LeanProject.GraphInvariantsComputable\n\nopen SimpleGraph Finset\n\nexample (s : Finset ℕ) (k : ℕ) : Option.getD s.max 0 ≤ k := by\n  cases h : s.max with\n  | bot =>\n    -- Goal is Option.getD ⊥ 0 ≤ k\n    exact Nat.zero_le k\n  | coe a =>\n    -- Goal is Option.getD (↑a) 0 ≤ k\n    change a ≤ k\n    sorry\n\nexample (s : Finset ℕ) (k n : ℕ) : k ≤ Option.getD s.min n := by\n  cases h : s.min with\n  | top =>\n    -- Goal is k ≤ Option.getD ⊤ n\n    change k ≤ n\n    sorry\n  | coe a =>\n    -- Goal is k ≤ Option.getD (↑a) n\n    change k ≤ a\n    sorry\n\nEOF\n/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/tools/antigravity/check.sh scratch.lean\n\nTask logs are available at: file:///tmp/agyhome.ORAQte/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/42667f07-7a6a-4c4a-956f-ef86057f6aae/.system_generated/tasks/task-143.log\nYOU MUST TAKE ONE OF THE FOLLOWING TWO ACTIONS: A) either proceed to other relevant work (if any) or, B) simply update the user with a short message (that you have launched the command and will wait for it to finish) and end the turn.\n DO NOTHING ELSE."}
